      automatics: [ { name: "5-Speed Automatic (GM 5L40-E)", torqueLimit: "390 Nm", oilType: "Dexron VI", note: "The absolute weakest link of the early E53 3.0d. It is famously incapable of handling the torque of the diesel engine. The torque converter lockup clutch fails, and the valve body wears out. Requires strict fluid/filter changes every 60k km, but failure is highly likely." } ]
